   "triaged": [
    "not a bug (documented limitation): WezTerm.app ships a placeholder CFBundleShortVersionString 0.1.0 and CFBundleVersion 1 in every release, so osquery always reports 0.1.0; PR #53892 (adds the FMA) documents it and uses a cdhash patched query instead of a version compare. Not #38583: bundle_version is '1', persisting it wouldn't help",
    "harness: wezterm ran on 858, 860 and 865 at once on 2026-11-18; 860 had added the title and removed its installer when its retry ended (22:04:47Z), mid-way through 865's retry (22:03:22-22:06:14Z), so 865's uninstall and second install got 400 and its uninstalls never ran. Fixed in the harness by 51a5f734 (2026-11-20: remove_if_added waits while another host has the title installed or pending). Rerun on 865 2026-11-24: 2/2 clean (every uninstall 202, app removed). Not Fleet, not 4.95",
    "harness: wezterm ran on 858, 860 and 865 at once on 2026-11-18; 860 had added the title and removed its installer when its retry ended (22:04:47Z), mid-way through 865's retry (22:03:22-22:06:14Z), so 865's uninstall and second install got 400 and its uninstalls never ran. Fixed in the harness by 51a5f734 (2026-11-20: remove_if_added waits while another host has the title installed or pending). Rerun on 865 2026-11-24: 2/2 clean (every uninstall 202, app removed). Not Fleet, not 4.95",
    "harness: wezterm ran on 858, 860 and 865 at once on 2026-11-18; 860 had added the title and removed its installer when its retry ended (22:04:47Z), mid-way through 865's retry (22:03:22-22:06:14Z), so 865's uninstall and second install got 400 and its uninstalls never ran. Fixed in the harness by 51a5f734 (2026-11-20: remove_if_added waits while another host has the title installed or pending). Rerun on 865 2026-11-24: 2/2 clean (every uninstall 202, app removed). Not Fleet, not 4.95"
   ],
